{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":79967502,"ns":0,"title":"Accessible quasi-category","extract":"In mathematics, especially category theory, an accessible quasi-category is a quasi-category in which each object is an ind-object on some small quasi-category. In particular, an accessible quasi-category is typically large (not small).","description":"Category in category theory","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}